OL,3,GNEWSACareers charities 'vital' for
OL,4,Ayoung job-seekers
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome young people in East Sussex have
OL,7,Fcalled for greater investment in
OL,8,Fcareers charities, saying they provide
OL,9,Fcrucial support in helping them
OL,10,Fnavigate the job market and secure
OL,11,Femployment.
OL,13,FIt comes as former Labour minister Alan
OL,14,FMilburn's report, due to be published
OL,15,Fon Tuesday, will set out
OL,16,Frecommendations on creating more
OL,17,Femployment for under-25s.
OL,19,FThere are nearly one million 16 to
OL,20,F24-year-olds not in employment,
OL,21,Feducation or training (Neets) in the
OL,22,FUK, official figures show.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
